   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Prompt: The sky, wherever it appears in the composition: replace it with a new sky that best complements the scene's existing lighting, time of day, and mood. Preserve the foreground and all non-sky subjects, horizon line(s), composition, and existing lighting direction on the ground -- do not relight or recolor any non-sky elements. Match the color temperature and light direction of the new sky to the ambient lighting already present in the scene. Change moderately. No added objects, no altered subject identity, no text or artifacts, no changes to foreground exposure or contrast.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
